<view class="cart-page">
  <view class="cart-head">
    <view>
      <view class="cart-title">采购单</view>
      <view class="cart-sub">库存、起订量、价格与采购资质将在提交前再次校验</view>
    </view>
    <button class="continue-btn" bindtap="goHome">继续选品</button>
  </view>

  <view class="member-note">
    <view>
      <view class="member-note-title">当前显示B端采购价</view>
      <view class="member-note-sub">正式订单以提交时库存、区域、数量及业务政策校验结果为准。</view>
    </view>
    <text class="preview-tag" wx:if="{{isPreview}}">界面预览</text>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{items.length}}">
    <view class="cart-select-row">
      <view class="select-all" bindtap="toggleAll">
        <view class="checkbox {{allChecked?'checked':''}}"></view>
        <text>全选</text>
      </view>
      <text class="cart-count-copy">共 {{items.length}} 种商品 · 已选 {{selectedSkuCount}} 种</text>
    </view>

    <view class="cart-list">
      <view class="cart-item premium-cart-item" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="key">
        <view class="checkbox {{item.checked?'checked':''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-key="{{item.key}}"></view>
        <image class="cart-img" src="{{item.product.image}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="goProduct" data-id="{{item.product.id}}"></image>
        <view class="cart-content">
          <view class="cart-name" bindtap="goProduct" data-id="{{item.product.id}}">{{item.product.name}}</view>
          <view class="cart-meta">{{item.product.brand}} · {{item.spec}}</view>
          <view class="cart-maker">{{item.product.maker}}</view>
          <view class="cart-status-row">
            <text class="cart-stock" wx:if="{{item.product.stock>0}}">库存 {{item.product.stock}}{{item.product.unit}}</text>
            <text class="cart-stock cart-stock-warn" wx:else>库存需确认</text>
            <text class="cart-member-tag">{{item.product.moq}}{{item.product.unit}}起订</text>
          </view>
          <view class="cart-price-line">
            <view>
              <text class="cart-price">采购价 ¥{{item.product.price}}</text>
              <view class="cart-line-total">小计 ¥{{item.lineTotal}}</view>
            </view>
            <button class="remove-btn" bindtap="remove" data-key="{{item.key}}">移除</button>
          </view>
          <view class="quantity premium-quantity">
            <button class="qty-btn" bindtap="minus" data-key="{{item.key}}">−</button>
            <text class="qty-value">{{item.qty}}</text>
            <button class="qty-btn" bindtap="plus" data-key="{{item.key}}">＋</button>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="cart-support-block">
      <view class="cart-service-entry" bindtap="goService" hover-class="cart-support-pressed">
        <view>
          <view class="cart-support-kicker">CUSTOMER SERVICE</view>
          <view class="cart-support-title">需要报价、找货或订单协助？</view>
          <view class="cart-support-desc">采购、商品、订单、物流或售后问题，可直接与客服沟通。</view>
        </view>
        <view class="cart-support-arrow">→</view>
      </view>

      <view class="cart-account" bindtap="goProfile" hover-class="cart-account-pressed">
        <view class="cart-account-topline">
          <view class="cart-account-level">PROCUREMENT ACCOUNT · {{customer.level}}</view>
          <view class="cart-account-link">采购账户 →</view>
        </view>
        <view class="cart-account-company">{{customer.companyName}}</view>
        <view class="cart-account-stats">
          <view class="cart-account-stat"><text class="strong">{{customer.pendingShip}}</text><text>待发货</text></view>
          <view class="cart-account-stat"><text class="strong">{{customer.pendingReceive}}</text><text>待收货</text></view>
          <view class="cart-account-stat"><text class="strong">{{customer.frequentSku}}</text><text>常购品种</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="cart-summary">
      <view class="summary-line"><text>采购金额</text><text>¥{{amount}}</text></view>
      <view class="summary-line total"><text>预计合计</text><text>¥{{total}}</text></view>
      <view class="summary-help">运费、活动政策、发票与最终供货条件在确认采购单时统一校验。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="bottom-space"></view>
    <view class="cart-footer premium-cart-footer">
      <view class="footer-select" bindtap="toggleAll"><view class="checkbox {{allChecked?'checked':''}}"></view><text>全选</text></view>
      <view class="footer-total"><text class="footer-label">合计</text><text class="footer-price">¥{{total}}</text><text class="footer-meta">已选 {{selectedCount}} 件</text></view>
      <button class="btn-primary checkout-btn" bindtap="checkout" disabled="{{selectedCount===0}}">确认采购</button>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="empty-state premium-empty cart-empty-under-head">
    <view class="empty-kicker">PROCUREMENT LIST</view>
    <text class="strong">采购单还是空的</text>
    <text>从首页、分类或搜索中选择需要采购的商品。加入时会自动按起订量计算。</text>
    <button class="btn-primary empty-button" bindtap="goHome">去选品</button>
  </view>
</view>
